        {
          "text": "The pose detection locks in to another person standing between camera and player. That person is only visible above the waist. Think about extending criteria for identifying player, that the whole body needs to be visible. This may be a real use case also for amateuer player uploads when a coach is standing nearby. Think about ways to identify the player if multiple people are in the video.",
